# Academy Loop Round 27 — YouTube embed fix (2026-08-30)

## Problem
Topic video pages showed a blank black box — CSP in `next.config.ts` had no `frame-src`, so YouTube iframes were blocked (default-src 'self' only).

## Fix
- Added `frame-src` for youtube.com + youtube-nocookie.com
- Added `img-src` for i.ytimg.com (thumbnail poster while iframe loads)
- `YouTubeEmbed` → client component with thumbnail poster + onLoad fade
- `lib/youtube-embed.ts` helpers + unit test
- E2E: topic page iframe src check for network-devices

## Validation
- npm run validate
- npm run test:e2e (smoke incl. topic embed)
